do with that information?

04:46.430 --> 04:50.430
Nothing. It's not like I want to find her.

04:50.430 --> 04:52.810
I won't bother her or Maho.

04:52.810 --> 04:57.310
I just can't stand not knowing forever.

04:58.440 --> 05:01.820
<i>Gramps invited people he knew to that party.</i>

05:02.230 --> 05:06.360
