Chiyo-san's granddaughter.</i>

05:06.360 --> 05:08.570
<i>But the same could be said about Akane.</i>

05:09.160 --> 05:14.120
<i>Still, that girl was polite, kind, 
and had the smile of an angel.</i>

05:14.120 --> 05:16.570
<i>She's nothing like the Akane I know today.</i>

05:17.170 --> 05:19.790
