05:42.440 --> 05:46.610
You like me so much, you wanna be my doll?

05:46.610 --> 05:50.870
I won't be a doll. I just 
want to talk in private.

05:50.870 --> 05:52.950
A date with Shii-chan?

05:50.870 --> 05:53.870
Yay, date.

05:52.950 --> 05:55.880
Of course I'll go! Let's skip school!

05:53.870 --> 05:55.880
