06:23.230 --> 06:26.780
Grandpa ( Hojo )

06:27.820 --> 06:29.610
<i>Pick up the damn phone!</i>

06:29.610 --> 06:30.700
Wh-What the hell?

06:30.700 --> 06:32.200
Is there a camera on the TV?

06:32.200 --> 06:34.540
Have you been spying on us this entire time?

06:35.330 --> 06:36.950
<i>Rest easy, I wouldn't do that.</i>

06:36.950 --> 06:38.540
<i>This is just a video call.</i>

06:38.540 --> 06:40.080
What do you want?

06:40.080 --> 06:43.340
<i>Can't I call you just to 
see how you're doing?</i>

06:43.340 --> 06:45.170
What are you, my girlfriend?

06:45.460 --> 06:49.720
<i>We're celebrating my cousin's 
70th birthday next Saturday.</i>

06:49.720 --> 06:52.680
<i>The entire Hojo family will be there.</i>

06:52.680 --> 06:53.930
<i>I suggest you come, too.</i>

06:54.180 --> 06:58.310
Your cousin? The one who kept the 
family in check all these years?

06:58.310 --> 06:59.440
<i>That's right.</i>

06:59.440 --> 07:04.060
<i>She's dealt with annoying relatives 
who want a say in the company.</i>

07:04.060 --> 07:09.240
<i>If you plan to take my place one day, 
you'll have to get along with her.</i>

07:09.240 --> 07:11.650
Gotcha. I'll bring a present then.

07:13.740 --> 07:16.950
I heard voices in here. Were 
you talking to yourself again?

07:16.950 --> 07:19.460
You must really have no friends.

07:19.460 --> 07:22.710
Don't treat me like a loner 
that talks to himself.

07:22.710 --> 07:24.630
I was on the phone with Gramps.

07:24.630 --> 07:25.670
Tenryu-san?

07:25.670 --> 07:26.590
Yeah.

07:26.590 --> 07:29.340
Apparently, my relatives 
are getting together.

07:29.340 --> 07:32.470
So I got invited, too. Wanna come?

07:32.470 --> 07:33.970
What? Why me?

07:34.220 --> 07:36.420
We gotta introduce you to the family.

07:36.420 --> 07:39.180
I-Introduce me? Don't say 
that like we're married!

07:39.180 --> 07:40.140
Well we are.

07:40.140 --> 07:41.810
We're not married!

07:41.810 --> 07:45.690
It's not like a formal thing. It's just a party.

07:45.690 --> 07:48.860
The older folks will drink 
and have fun on their own.

07:48.860 --> 07:50.780
You won't have to worry about formalities.

07:50.780 --> 07:55.570
If anything, you can come for 
the ridiculously fancy food.

07:56.530 --> 07:59.830
I can't. Not without time 
to mentally prepare.

07:59.830 --> 08:02.960
You're overthinking it. Shise will be there.

08:02.960 --> 08:06.210
So Shisei-san's mother will be there, too?

08:06.210 --> 08:07.720
Yeah, I think so.

08:09.880 --> 08:13.880
I won't force you, but I'll 
be staying the night.

08:13.880 --> 08:16.100
Won't you be lonely staying 
home by yourself?

08:16.100 --> 08:17.760
O-Of course not!

08:17.760 --> 08:20.020
In fact, I'll be relieved without you here!

08:20.020 --> 08:22.480
Are you sure?
What if the power goes out?

08:22.480 --> 08:23.730
You might die of shock.

08:23.730 --> 08:24.650
No, I won't!

08:24.650 --> 08:26.480
Who do you think I am?

08:26.480 --> 08:28.100
A scaredy-cat.

08:28.100 --> 08:29.530
I won't get scared.

08:29.530 --> 08:32.150
If there's a ghost, I'll 
exterminate it myself.

08:32.570 --> 08:33.860
So you're an exorcist now?

08:33.860 --> 08:35.490
You sure you'll be okay?

08:35.490 --> 08:37.240
Can you stay home by yourself?

08:37.240 --> 08:38.490
Are you making fun of me?

08:38.490 --> 08:41.950
I've been wanting to hang out with 
Himari, so it's perfect timing!

08:41.950 --> 08:45.870
Whether it's overnight or a full month, 
go ahead and stay as long as you want!

08:47.620 --> 08:49.040
See ya later.

08:50.340 --> 08:51.880
You sure about this?

08:51.880 --> 08:52.670
About what?

08:52.670 --> 08:55.130
I'm busy, you know. Go 
ahead and leave already!

08:55.760 --> 08:57.590
Brother-kun, good morning.

08:57.590 --> 08:59.140
Good morning, Saito-kun.

08:59.350 --> 09:00.680
Ready?

09:00.680 --> 09:02.140
Thank you.

09:02.680 --> 09:06.150
<i>Huh, so she cools her jets 
in front of Aunt Reiko.</i>

09:13.940 --> 09:16.280
Welcome home, Saito-sama.

09:16.280 --> 09:18.370
Welcome home, Reiko-sama.

09:18.370 --> 09:20.780
It's a pleasure to see 
you again, Shisei-sama.

09:20.780 --> 09:23.410
Technically, this isn't my home.

09:23.410 --> 09:27.420
The head household considers 
you one of their own.

09:27.710 --> 09:31.670
I hear they actually wanted to 
adopt your father, as well.

09:31.670 --> 09:33.960
Brother-kun, let's go skiing.

09:33.960 --> 09:35.880
Miss Shisei! Please refrain!

09:35.880 --> 09:37.430
Your clothing!

09:43.420 --> 09:46.810
Ah, Saito! Shisei! Sit right here.

09:46.810 --> 09:49.940
I really prefer not to sit next to drunks.

09:49.940 --> 09:52.940
We're all drunks tonight! Give it up!

09:55.440 --> 09:57.700
Congratulations

Hojo Saito

09:55.940 --> 09:57.700
It's a pleasure to see you again.

09:57.700 --> 09:59.870
Congratulations on your birthday.

09:59.870 --> 10:02.710
Congrats. I hope you live some more.

10:02.710 --> 10:07.210
Thank you. I should be around 
for another thousand years or so.

10:08.580 --> 10:11.420
That hardly sounds like a 
joke coming from Shizu!

10:11.420 --> 10:13.710
By the way, where's your wife?

10:13.710 --> 10:15.340
She's not coming tonight.

10:15.710 --> 10:18.600
She says she's shy about meeting the relatives.

10:18.600 --> 10:20.800
My, what a sweetheart.

10:20.800 --> 10:22.930
Are you two getting along?

10:22.930 --> 10:24.470
Where's my great grandchild?

10:24.470 --> 10:25.980
There won't be one.

10:25.980 --> 10:28.270
We've agreed to your terms 
on getting married.

10:28.270 --> 10:30.230
But we're not like that.

10:30.230 --> 10:34.190
My god, what a waste! You're newlyweds!

10:34.190 --> 10:37.190
This is supposed to be the 
best time of your life!

10:37.190 --> 10:39.490
Are you at least taking baths together?

10:39.490 --> 10:41.120
Wh-Why would we do that?!

10:41.120 --> 10:43.780
Tenryu, give it a rest.

10:43.780 --> 10:45.870
It's a touchy subject for young people.

10:45.870 --> 10:51.210
<i>She's gotta be the only person in the 
world who can talk to Gramps like that.</i>

10:51.210 --> 10:55.510
Would you mind telling him to stop 
forcing people to get married, too?

10:55.760 --> 11:00.880
I have to admit, I was stunned when 
I first heard of this silly arrangement.

11:00.880 --> 11:05.510
Still, it was my own choice 
to support Tenryu for life.

11:05.510 --> 11:07.140
There's no use arguing.

11:07.140 --> 11:08.770
Chiyo's done well for herself, too.

11:08.770 --> 11:12.770
The Sakuramoris can influence even 
politicians and bureaucrats.

11:12.770 --> 11:15.360
We Hojo have done well marrying them.

11:15.360 --> 11:17.900
Take good care that 
your wife is content.

11:17.900 --> 11:18.650
Right...

11:18.650 --> 11:20.030
Although...

11:20.450 --> 11:26.780
I always assumed Saito would 
eventually marry Shisei.

11:26.780 --> 11:28.780
What? No way.

11:35.790 --> 11:36.800
What's wrong?

11:36.800 --> 11:37.800
What do you mean?

11:37.800 --> 11:39.800
Um, your face is red.

11:39.800 --> 11:43.930
Nothing. I just ate a metric ton 
of cayenne peppers.

11:43.930 --> 11:46.100
How did you hide so many peppers?

11:46.100 --> 11:48.310
Shise is a master of spatial manipulation.

11:48.310 --> 11:51.690
I can freely materialize cayenne 
peppers from a parallel universe.

11:51.690 --> 11:55.060
What a talent. You should 
put that to better use.

11:56.110 --> 11:58.070
Wait, are you blushing?

11:58.070 --> 11:59.320
No, I'm not.

12:03.820 --> 12:06.410
She was just kidding. Don't sweat it.

12:06.410 --> 12:09.370
Doesn't it bother you at all, Brother-kun?

12:09.370 --> 12:11.830
That was nothing compared 
to Gramps's sexual harassment.

12:11.830 --> 12:12.830
Fine.

12:16.380 --> 12:20.460
Shise demands Brother-kun 
pat her on the head.

12:20.460 --> 12:22.420
Sure, I guess.

12:32.430 --> 12:33.730
Come on in, Himari!

12:34.850 --> 12:37.270
Wh-Whoa, what's wrong?

12:37.730 --> 12:40.110
Thanks for having me over.

12:40.110 --> 12:43.280
I thought you hated me for what I did.

12:43.280 --> 12:46.070
I would never hate you.

12:46.070 --> 12:47.620
What made you think that?

12:48.030 --> 12:52.500
Because of what I did to Saito-kun 
just 'cause of that plan.

12:52.500 --> 12:54.860
I thought you were mad at me.

12:54.860 --> 12:56.750
I'm not mad at you.

12:56.750 --> 13:01.130
I know how hard you worked for us.

13:01.130 --> 13:04.140
Besides, I don't care what Saito does!

13:04.140 --> 13:05.050
Really?

13:05.050 --> 13:05.840
Really!

13:05.840 --> 13:08.300
That's such a relief. I love you, Akane!

13:08.300 --> 13:09.760
I love you, too.

13:10.180 --> 13:12.270
We're okay, right?

13:12.270 --> 13:16.900
No matter what happens from now on, 
promise we'll stay best friends?

13:16.900 --> 13:19.360
S-Sure! Of course!

13:19.820 --> 13:21.690
<i>No matter what happens?</i>

13:28.530 --> 13:30.620
I got some fresh strawberries at the store.

13:30.620 --> 13:32.540
So I thought I'd bake cupcakes!

13:32.540 --> 13:34.500
I brought some good Darjeeling tea!

13:41.250 --> 13:44.510
I'm the most comfortable 
when I'm with you, Himari!

13:44.510 --> 13:48.550
Totally! I'm the same with you, too!

13:48.550 --> 13:50.970
It's like you'd forgive me for anything!

13:50.970 --> 13:53.470
I dunno about <i>anything</i>.

13:53.470 --> 13:55.730
Aww, come on!

13:56.020 --> 13:58.230
Fine then, I guess.

14:02.860 --> 14:04.530
Not bad!

14:04.530 --> 14:08.110
Oh yeah! Lemme send Saito-kun a pic!

14:08.530 --> 14:12.240
Himari, you and Saito exchanged contacts?

14:12.240 --> 14:14.580
Yeah! A while ago.

14:14.580 --> 14:16.410
A while ago?

14:16.660 --> 14:18.710
<i>That cheater!</i>

14:18.710 --> 14:19.630
<i>Huh?</i>

14:19.630 --> 14:23.420
<i>Wait, it's not like we're going out or anything.</i>

14:23.420 --> 14:24.460
Akane?

14:24.460 --> 14:27.720
Do you want me to delete his contact?

14:27.720 --> 14:29.590
N-No, not at all!

14:29.590 --> 14:33.260
I hope he's not bombarding 
you with messages!

14:33.260 --> 14:36.930
He's actually the one dealing 
with me every night!

14:36.930 --> 14:37.770
Every night?

14:37.770 --> 14:38.440
Yup!

14:39.440 --> 14:42.520
I even sent him a selfie out 
of the bath last night.

14:44.440 --> 14:47.070
Is he forcing you to do this?!
You can talk to me about it!

14:47.070 --> 14:52.740
No! I sent it myself hoping 
it would turn him on.

14:52.740 --> 14:54.910
You meant to send it? Why?

14:54.910 --> 14:58.660
You can't hold back when you 
want your crush to like you!

14:58.660 --> 15:01.750
Not that it worked. He totally ignored me.

15:02.130 --> 15:05.300
I can't believe he blew off 
my best friend, that idiot!

15:05.590 --> 15:08.090
I'm just happy he hasn't blocked me!

15:08.920 --> 15:10.550
Hey, look! He texted back!

15:10.550 --> 15:11.830
You can bake cakes?

15:10.550 --> 15:11.830
Pretty cool.

15:12.050 --> 15:14.080
Pretty cool.

15:12.050 --> 15:14.080
I'll save some for you.

15:12.050 --> 15:14.080
They're made with love!

15:14.300 --> 15:15.090
I'll save some for you.

15:14.300 --> 15:15.090
They're made with love!

15:14.300 --> 15:15.090
Hold the love.

15:15.310 --> 15:16.340
They're made with love!

15:15.310 --> 15:16.340
Hold the love.

15:15.310 --> 15:16.340
Then I'll send some love

15:15.310 --> 15:16.340
ahead of time!

15:16.560 --> 15:17.340
Hold the love.

15:16.560 --> 15:17.340
Then I'll send some love

15:16.560 --> 15:17.340
ahead of time!

15:17.560 --> 15:19.050
ahead of time!

15:19.060 --> 15:21.020
<i>What's going on?</i>

15:22.860 --> 15:24.150
Oops, sorry!

15:24.150 --> 15:27.190
I didn't mean to leave 
you hanging. I'll help!

15:27.190 --> 15:28.740
It's fine.

15:28.740 --> 15:31.780
I'm not a master at texting anyway.

15:29.950 --> 15:33.950
<b>Certification
of
Failure</b>

15:29.950 --> 15:33.950
<b>Amateur</b>

15:29.950 --> 15:33.950
<b>Akane Sakuramori</b>

15:29.950 --> 15:33.950
<b>Japan Texting
Skill Certification</b>

15:31.780 --> 15:33.950
I'm a certified texting amateur.

15:33.950 --> 15:35.780
You're a what?

15:38.080 --> 15:41.500
Akane, are you waiting for 
Saito-kun to text you?

15:41.500 --> 15:44.790
Wh-Why would I be waiting for 
a text from a guy like him?

15:45.750 --> 15:49.340
Can you guess what the 
opposite of "like" is?

15:49.340 --> 15:50.720
"Hate," obviously!

15:51.090 --> 15:52.340
Nope.

15:53.340 --> 15:56.850
The opposite of "like" 
is "indifference," apparently.

15:57.310 --> 16:02.440
Because you can't hate someone 
you don't care about.

16:02.440 --> 16:04.930
Wh-What's that have to do with anything?

16:07.860 --> 16:10.030
Time to top these with strawberries!

16:10.030 --> 16:11.030
Yeah...

16:13.450 --> 16:14.990
I had so much fun today!

16:15.200 --> 16:16.030
See ya!

16:16.030 --> 16:17.160
Yup, see ya!

16:24.250 --> 16:27.500
I can get some studying done 
now that Saito isn't here!

16:27.500 --> 16:31.970
I'll get ahead of him and beat 
him to a pulp in our next exam!

16:34.510 --> 16:36.510
<b>No new notifications</b>

16:36.850 --> 16:39.970
I swear, I'm not lonely...

16:42.480 --> 16:45.020
Oh no! Kan-chan fell!

16:45.020 --> 16:47.190
I'll avenge you, Kan-chan!

16:47.190 --> 16:49.270
Someone bring the sake keg!

16:49.270 --> 16:51.440
Umeyan fell, too!

16:54.030 --> 16:56.070
Go on, drink up!

16:56.070 --> 16:57.280
I'm a minor.

16:57.280 --> 16:59.080
I know that!

16:59.080 --> 17:01.040
I'm telling you to drink...

17:01.040 --> 17:03.540
Green veggie oolong tea!

17:03.540 --> 17:04.790
Why did you mix those?!

17:04.790 --> 17:07.420
Because it's healthy, of course!

17:07.420 --> 17:10.300
You just wanna watch your grandkid suffer.

17:10.300 --> 17:14.800
Right you are. Now suffer, my child.

17:27.190 --> 17:28.930
Thank you.

17:29.190 --> 17:31.440
Miss Shisei must be tired.

17:32.070 --> 17:35.070
You can sleep here as well, Saito-sama.

17:35.070 --> 17:37.820
Miss Shisei will wake up happy.

17:37.820 --> 17:39.700
That would leave you 
without a place to sleep.

17:39.700 --> 17:43.830
I wouldn't mind letting 
you enjoy the both of us.

17:43.830 --> 17:45.460
Enjoy what?

17:45.460 --> 17:46.580
A harem.

17:46.580 --> 17:50.200
It's every gentleman's dream to 
enjoy a princess and a maid at once.

17:50.200 --> 17:52.500
There's hardly any space anyway.

17:52.500 --> 17:54.210
I'll sleep in the next room.

17:54.300 --> 17:56.090
<b>Virgin lol</b>

17:54.510 --> 17:56.090
What a virgin.

17:56.090 --> 17:57.130
What's that?

17:57.130 --> 17:57.970
Nothing.

17:57.970 --> 18:00.680
What an earnest gentleman you are.

18:00.680 --> 18:04.560
My heart's trembling with 
overwhelming respect for you.

18:04.560 --> 18:07.020
You are truly a noble man full of dignity.

18:07.020 --> 18:10.230
You're a terrible actor and I 
know you meant none of that.

18:11.860 --> 18:14.860
Good night and sweet dreams.

18:16.490 --> 18:17.990
Jeez.

18:21.490 --> 18:23.790
Akane Sakuramori

18:24.540 --> 18:26.620
What's wrong? Is something wrong?

18:26.620 --> 18:28.830
<i>N-Nothing really.</i>

18:28.830 --> 18:30.830
You just wanted to hear my voice?

18:30.830 --> 18:32.710
<i>N-No! It's not that!</i>

18:33.800 --> 18:37.220
<i>I-I just feel out of place not 
being able to bicker at you.</i>

18:37.220 --> 18:38.340
Out of place?

18:38.340 --> 18:42.390
<i>Yeah! I mean, we've been constantly 
fighting since freshman year!</i>

18:42.390 --> 18:45.220
<i>It's so quiet all of a 
sudden, it's just weird!</i>

18:45.220 --> 18:47.890
You mean it's not easier without me?

18:47.890 --> 18:50.040
<i>Sure, it's easier, but...</i>

18:50.330 --> 18:53.440
<i>Come home soon, okay?</i>

18:54.150 --> 18:55.070
Yeah.

18:57.990 --> 19:00.450
"Home," huh?

19:02.410 --> 19:04.080
<i>I can't fall asleep.</i>

19:04.080 --> 19:07.330
<i>I haven't slept alone in so long.</i>

19:07.870 --> 19:09.290
<i>There's no such thing as ghosts.</i>

19:09.290 --> 19:10.370
<i>Or mice!</i>

19:10.370 --> 19:13.210
<i>If I can't see or hear it, it doesn't exist!</i>

19:24.100 --> 19:26.600
<i>What is that? A burglar?</i>

19:28.890 --> 19:32.860
<i>I'm so scared! 
If only Saito were here, he'd help me!</i>

19:34.190 --> 19:36.190
You burglar!

19:36.940 --> 19:37.900
Saito?

19:40.570 --> 19:43.440
Could ya be a bit more gentle?

19:46.160 --> 19:47.790
What are you doing?

19:47.790 --> 19:50.330
I couldn't get in 'cause of 
the chain on the front door!

19:50.330 --> 19:52.370
Then buzz the intercom!

19:52.370 --> 19:53.470
I did! Numerous times!

19:53.790 --> 19:56.380
Oh yeah, I had my headphones on.

19:56.380 --> 20:00.670
You didn't answer your phone and 
I didn't wanna wake you up.

20:00.670 --> 20:03.090
Still, you didn't have to crawl in 
from the second floor.

20:03.090 --> 20:05.210
I thought you were staying the night.

20:05.210 --> 20:09.480
That was the plan, but I found 
some buses to get back here.

20:09.480 --> 20:10.590
What?

20:10.930 --> 20:13.770
I took the bus as far as 
I could, then I walked.

20:13.770 --> 20:16.270
You walked home? For how long?

20:16.270 --> 20:17.820
Like two hours.

20:17.820 --> 20:18.980
Are you crazy?!

20:18.980 --> 20:20.070
Well...

20:20.900 --> 20:25.250
I felt out of place, too. 
Not bickering with you.

20:30.450 --> 20:33.410
I'm real sweaty, so I'm gonna take a shower.

20:33.830 --> 20:35.830
O-Okay.

20:43.510 --> 20:46.850
<i>Where did he walk to get so dirty?</i>

20:47.300 --> 20:49.060
<i>He's so hopeless.</i>

21:00.110 --> 21:01.820
Th-That was quick.

21:01.820 --> 21:03.780
Were you in the changing room a second ago?

21:03.780 --> 21:07.280
Of course not! Are you 
accusing me of peeping?

21:07.280 --> 21:10.290
No, but why are you so out of breath?

21:10.290 --> 21:12.330
I-I was dancing!

21:12.330 --> 21:14.370
This late at night? Wow, you're spry.

21:14.370 --> 21:15.790
You gotta show me that sometime.

21:15.790 --> 21:16.790
No way!

21:16.790 --> 21:18.420
You won't get to see one second of it!

21:18.420 --> 21:19.040
Hmph!

21:20.380 --> 21:23.380
H-Hey, wanna stay up and talk?

21:23.380 --> 21:28.300
Tell me about what happened at the 
party and everyone who was there.

21:29.300 --> 21:30.240
Hey.

21:30.960 --> 21:33.300
He must've been really tired.

21:33.690 --> 21:36.380
You really are an idiot.

21:41.190 --> 21:42.850
Welcome home.

21:45.240 --> 21:47.320
<i>I didn't mean to hear that.</i>

21:48.050 --> 21:51.040
<i>Is it just me, or is she 
really close tonight?</i>

21:51.040 --> 21:52.830
<i>Her hair's brushing my neck.</i>

21:53.950 --> 21:56.120
<i>Wait, that voice just now...</i>

21:56.710 --> 21:57.960
<i>That's right!</i>

21:58.360 --> 22:02.350
<i>It reminds me of that girl's 
voice from the party...</i>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.970
<b>#12</b>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.970
<b>I'm Getting Married to a Guy
I Hate in My Class</b>
